OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start but turning
OL,6,Fgradually cloudier through the day
OL,7,Fwith some light rain or drizzle
OL,8,Fpossible across Cumbria. Staying
OL,9,Fgenerally dry elsewhere with the best
OL,10,Fof the sunshine in southern regions.
OL,11,FFeeling warmer than in recent days.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FLow cloud and hill fog across
OL,14,Fthe north of the region, thick enough
OL,15,Fto bring some light rain and drizzle.
OL,16,FDrier in the south. Mild for the time
OL,17,Fof year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
