OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FLow cloud in the north slowly
OL,6,Flifts through the day but some spot of
OL,7,Frain will remain. Possible brighter
OL,8,Fspells in the south later. Feeling
OL,9,Fwarm for September.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FTurning much wetter on Wednesday with
OL,13,Fsome heavy rain. But drier once again
OL,14,Fon Thursday. Another band of rain
OL,15,Fmoves into the northwest into Friday.
OL,16,FTemperatures return to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
